--------------------The "assert" statements that start with "@@@" in the given csharp code corresponds to the following assertion:

"If the return value is positive, return value is at least the index of x in old list".

The corresponding csharp code for this assertion would look like:

```cs
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0, "If the return value is positive, return value is at least the index of x in old list");
